// The icons: Apps SDK UI's 755, by name (components/icons/apps-sdk/NAME.svg). A component names
// an icon by its constant here (IC_COPY), so a misspelled icon doesn't compile, and the browser
// backend draws it from its file: each file is one <svg id="i"> in currentColor, so an icon takes
// the colour of the text around it (brand icons with their own fills keep them).
//
// The artwork is Apps SDK UI's (https://github.com/openai/apps-sdk-ui), MIT, copyright 2025 OpenAI:
// see components/icons/NOTICE. It was in the Rust tree as crates/openagents-ui/src/icons/generated.rs
// (tag coder-v1.0.0), and this file and the SVG files were written once from that. The constants are
// in the files' order by name; a new icon is added as a file and a row here, in order.
//   coax/bin/coax test components/core/icons.coax

